["The connection is down! We must act quickly, $PLAYER_NAME$. Let us rendezvous at Farondale. The final fight is at hand."] = true,
["Spiders! Of all the infernal demons the Legion could dispatch into my realm, why did it have to be spiders?"] = true,
["Meet me outside at once! It is time to sever the Legion's tendrils and free Azsuna!"] = true,
["The Burning Legion advances on Azsuna! We must thin their ranks to expose the heart of their threat!"] = true,
["The demonic presence recedes, but this is no time to be complacent. I await your arrival outside the Temple. It's time we press our advance."] = true,
["Strike at their defenses, $PLAYER_NAME$. Bring these demons down!"] = true,
["It is imperative that you destroy any clutches of eggs you find. This infestation must not spread!"] = true,
["Outstanding work, hero! Our alliance ensures the Legion will never conquer Azsuna!"] = true,
["The Legion drains our dragon allies of their magic. You must rescue them!"] = true,
