[248632] = {
["BroadcastText"] = {
["enUS"] = {
["Using a relic of the Void to breach the storm... It sounds risky, Umbric."] = true,
["Despite our long history of animosity, we elves have proven that together we are greater than our grievances."] = true,
["I will head there myself as soon as matters here are settled. Take care, both of you."] = true,
["We believe we can heal the Darkwell, and we would like you there when we do."] = true,
["With the shal'dorei, we have gathered together more elves in one place than we have seen in ages."] = true,
["You did what you had to, Umbric. We must enter the Voidstorm if we are to stop it. "] = true,
["You're needed in Fairbreeze, champion. A problem with the Lightbloom."] = true,
["$PLAYER_NAME$, you must get to the Vanguard leaders. The Sunwell is straining against Xal'atath's assault."] = true,
["The last time the Sunwell was threatened like this, the sin'dorei were nearly wiped out."] = true,
["Use discretion, Champion. We need both Umbric and the Vanguard."] = true,
["You made the right choice--the only choice. Now we can truly begin to fight back."] = true,
["If Fairbreeze is safe--the Voidstorm still looms."] = true,
["The Sunwell must not fall."] = true,
["Seek him out in Tranquillien. Reach out when you have more to share."] = true,
["She speaks of the Sunwell, not the Light."] = true,
["I trust--and hope--that things went well, $PLAYER_NAME$."] = true,
["Bishop Alonsus Faol has a plan to support those at the Sunwell. And to help Arator."] = true,
["Is everything all right, Lady Liadrin? You've said little since we arrived."] = true,
["He was speaking to his Lord-Regent."] = true,
["You have already taken so many of my Blood Knights to empower the Sunwell! Quel'Thalas is largely undefended!"] = true,
["Go. Quickly--Liadrin needs urgent assistance with the Amani."] = true,
["I sent Lady Liadrin to inform the Vanguard's commanders that they may deploy at once, and leave our city in peace."] = true,
["I suggest you hold your tongue, High Exarch. That \"fount\" you so blithely pretend to understand predates the existence of human civilization."] = true,
["That question worries me, Liadrin. Is it wrong for it to do so?"] = true,
["So the crash caused the Lightbloom to surge... Thank you. Rest easy, and leave this to us."] = true,
["$PLAYER_NAME$, return to the Sanctum of Light. This struggle is far from over."] = true,
["Small at first, but Fairbreeze now reports a problem. If the Sunwell is aggressive, what of the Lightbloom?"] = true,
["Despite Rommath's vocal opposition, I have decided to reach out to Magister Umbric and tap his expertise with the Void."] = true,
["Lady Liadrin left the moment we heard. Meet her and get any survivors out of there."] = true,
["If you found a pathway to Xal'atath, the Vanguard would leave. To say nothing of the power your people could acquire."] = true,
["Champion! We've cornered Zul'jan. It is time to bring this incursion to an end!"] = true,
["His help is deeply appreciated. I only wish word of it had arrived under better circumstances."] = true,
["Orweyna, your efforts saved Eversong this day. The haranir will always have a place in Silvermoon, should they wish it."] = true,
["I can protect you in the city, but the Vanguard will not allow you to approach the Sunwell. Results will change that."] = true,
["$PLAYER_NAME$? Thank the Light. With the storm breaking, we just might win this."] = true,
["And in all that time, I have never heard of the Sunwell reacting with that kind of... aggression. Liadrin, what was that beam of light?"] = true,
["I've received reports from the Sunwell that Faol's plan has worked. The defenders hold back the Voidstorm another day."] = true,
["Arator! Has Umbric agreed to lend his aid?"] = true,
["No one is questioning the Light's grace, Turalyon. Least of all the sin'dorei!"] = true,
["Perhaps the rifts between us will never fully heal. But we must at least attempt to bridge them."] = true,
["We've news from Suncrown. The Lightbloom has all but devoured the village."] = true,
["The Sunwell holds for now, only through the constant effort of its defenders. Should their strength waver..."] = true,
["Xal'atath's attacks grow stronger!"] = true,
["I have received word from Magister Umbric. The way to the Voidstorm is clear!"] = true,
["Perhaps you should save your words for when they are asked for, High Exarch. I suspect they would be better received."] = true,
},
},
["Name"] = {
["enUS"] = "Lor'themar Theron",
