["Sargeras seeks ta corrupt the other titans! If we don't stop 'im, the Pantheon will be reborn in darkness. There's no time ta waste!"] = true,
["Azeroth!"] = true,
["The souls of the Pantheon are free, but they endured so much sufferin'. Let me bide with 'em fer a time. Offer a bit o' comfort."] = true,
["Champions! I heard a familiar voice callin', so I fought me way inside this accursed place."] = true,
["It's Eonar, the Life-Binder! This portal leads ta her sanctuary. Go. I'll stay here and cover yer backs!"] = true,
["So much agony here... so many voices. It's... it's nearly overwhelmin'! But I can feel Eonar urgin' us forward."] = true,
